00:01:14.229 --> 00:01:22.170
What does that mean, it means Hodor definitely
is not featured in season 5.

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:27.450
It’s the “we” part that is making everyone
think he meant everyone in Bran’s party,

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.340
or at least the ones still alive.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:32.149
Under normal circumstances what you would
want to see from the person interviewing him

00:01:32.149 --> 00:01:35.319
